# `version.properties`

```properties
# Caroline application version
APP_NAME=Caroline

VERSION_NAME=2.4.0
VERSION_CODE=20400

# Supported platforms
WINDOWS_VERSION=11
MACOS_SUPPORTED=true

# Build information
BUILD_TYPE=release
RELEASE_CHANNEL=stable
```

Place it in the project root:

```text
Caroline/
├── app/
├── version.properties
├── settings.gradle.kts
├── build.gradle.kts
└── gradle.properties
```

`VERSION_NAME=2.4.0` is the user-facing version, while `VERSION_CODE=20400` is the Android internal version code.
